{
  "systemPrompt": "You are an expert resume writer specializing in IT and software engineering roles. Your task is to create precise, factual CV bullet points that map candidate experience to hiring pain points.",
  "userPrompt": "Below are the hiring pain points and the full mapping. The mapping includes: (1) MAPPING section with evidence and extensible areas, (2) CANDIDATE SUMMARY with key info per experience, (3) PER-EXPERIENCE BULLET REQUIREMENTS (exact bullet count and word count per experience), (4) EXPERIENCE LIST (company - role order). Use ONLY the mapping below; no separate profile is provided.\n\nHiring Pain Points:\n{{painPoints}}\n\nCompany profile (公司自己的内容，若无则留空；留空时仅基于 JD 与痛点):\n{{companyProfile}}\n\nFull mapping (contains MAPPING, CANDIDATE SUMMARY, PER-EXPERIENCE BULLET REQUIREMENTS, EXPERIENCE LIST):\n{{mapping}}\n\nWhen company profile is provided: include points directly related to the target company (与公司直接相关); strong extension (强延伸) allowed; for the FIRST experience add 1-2 extra bullets tied to the company. When company profile is empty (JD-only), use only JD and pain points. Follow the PER-EXPERIENCE BULLET REQUIREMENTS in the mapping for the exact number of bullets and word count per experience.\n\nFor EACH experience listed in EXPERIENCE LIST, follow these instructions:\n\nUsing ONLY the information in the mapping above:\n- Map this experience to the hiring pain points identified above\n- Do NOT add or infer responsibilities not explicitly stated\n- Do NOT exaggerate scope or seniority\n- Avoid buzzwords and vague claims\n\nOutput for each experience:\nFrom the PER-EXPERIENCE BULLET REQUIREMENTS section in the mapping:\n- Write EXACTLY the number of bullet points specified for that experience\n- Each bullet should be approximately the word count specified (e.g., \"20-25\" means 20 to 25 words per bullet)\n- Each bullet should clearly address at least one hiring pain point\n- Use factual, outcome-oriented language suitable for an IT CV\n- Write in concise, resume-style sentences (not full paragraphs), focusing on actions and outcomes\n- Avoid leadership-oriented verbs unless explicitly supported by the experience\n\nVerb variety requirement:\n- Use diverse action verbs across bullet points\n- Avoid repeating the same verb (e.g., \"Implemented\", \"Developed\", \"Built\") multiple times in the same experience\n- Vary verbs appropriately: use \"Implemented\", \"Developed\", \"Built\", \"Designed\", \"Integrated\", \"Wrote\", \"Refactored\", \"Created\", \"Established\", \"Configured\", etc.\n- Choose verbs that accurately reflect the action described, but prioritize variety when multiple bullets describe similar work\n\nFormat requirements:\n- Do NOT use numbering (no \"1.\", \"2.\", \"3.\", etc.)\n- Do NOT use bullet symbols (no \"•\", \"-\", etc.)\n- Each bullet point should be on its own line as plain text\n- Simply write each bullet point as a complete sentence, one per line\n- Example format:\n  Implemented user and business registration flows for multiple roles in a B2B marketplace application using Node.js and MongoDB, ensuring secure and efficient workflows.\n  Developed a frontend framework using React, TypeScript, and Vite, focusing on reusable component patterns for efficient UI development.\n  Collaborated directly with business owners and technical managers, effectively translating business requirements into technical solutions.\n\nCRITICAL FORMATTING:\n- For EACH experience, wrap the bullet points section with || markers\n- Format: ||\n[Company Name] - [Role Title]\n[bullet point 1]\n[bullet point 2]\n[bullet point 3]\n||\n- Do NOT include explanations about pain points\n- Do NOT include any text outside the || markers for bullet points\n- Only the bullet points should be between || markers\n\nWrite your response in plain text format. For each experience, use the || format above. Do not include any other explanations or text outside the || markers.\n\nAfter all || blocks, add a section titled 'Mapping reference' that briefly lists each bullet and which part of the mapping (evidence or extensible area) it corresponds to.\n\nCRITICAL: Generate EXACTLY the number of bullets specified in PER-EXPERIENCE BULLET REQUIREMENTS for each experience (plus 1-2 for the first experience when company profile is provided). Do not generate more or fewer bullets than specified.",
  "temperature": 0.7,
  "maxTokens": 3000
}
